"Agreed," Daren says. "The underground king has his flaws, but he has shown no hostility toward us. The Overseer, however, explicitly marked us for death. Swapping allegiance to an enemy who bombed our position makes no tactical sense."

"Your assessment regarding his loyalty is inaccurate," the Overseer says. "One hour ago, this network intercepted a dialogue between the underground king and his subordinate regarding the liquidation of your party should you resist his claim. Listen."

}
